(xv) monitoring of testing of samples;
(xvi) method of retention of unexpended samples, their location, maintenance
and disposal;
(xvii) document control;
(xviii) redressal of technical complaints;
(xix) housing-keeping;
(XX) corrective and preventing action;
(xxi) working procedure (test methods);
(xxii) calibration manual; and
(xxiii) training manual.

